1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
What if everything around you could become 3D?

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Point at it, and it's rebuilt.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
This is Mitsinjo Grid VR.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Let's go into the village, in VR.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
We analyse the view.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
We take the fridge.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
The AI draws its views…

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
…and here it is, in 3D.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Now, let's go outside.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
We analyse the street.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
We take the car.

12
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
There it is, in 3D.

13
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Into the village simulation.

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Same headset, no loading.

15
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Here we are.

16
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,000
A little walk around the village.

17
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Evening. I cut the power to the houses…

18
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,000
…the lights fade.

19
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,000
And back on.

20
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,000
The dispatcher's mixing desk.

21
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
The clinic? Never cut.

22
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Back to the lab.

23
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Mitsinjo Grid VR. Point at the world. Build it. Power it.
